  "result": "I fixed the board so archived issues no longer show up as cards. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThe cause was in `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`, the query that loads the board's cards. It only filtered by org and project and never checked whether an issue was archived. So archived issues came back and were placed into columns by their status. That's why the problem only appeared on the board: the issue list, the per-project counts and the exports all use queries that already drop archived issues.\n\nThe fix adds the same \"not archived\" check those other queries use. The service that feeds the board just passes this result through, so no other change was needed.",
